Dredge performance indicators
shall consist of the following data (in English units of measurement):
(1) Dredge cut swing width;
(2) Discharge pipeline length;
(3) Dredge length of advance (0000-2400 hour time);
(4) Elevation of cut, referenced to Low Water Reference Plane
(LWRP), Mean Low Gulf (MLG), or Mean Lower Low Water (MLLW),
whichever is applicable;
(5) Amount of material dredged per dredge advance length, in
cy/hr, based on quantity surveys.

